                                "sense_id": "6ad891af-92d3-3a08-ad0b-58093fdedc5e",
                                "text": "1932, Franc-Nohain, Guide du bon sens, chapter 7 “Le bon sens et la fraternité”, p. 145",
                                "translation": "There is an example that haunts me, and to which I return most willingly, because I deem it worthy to spend much thought on: this is the example of the hermit crab.",
